{"path":"memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor/destroy","title":"std::scoped_allocator_adaptor<OuterAlloc,InnerAlloc...>::destroy","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::scoped_allocator_adaptor&lt;OuterAlloc,InnerAlloc...&gt;::</span>destroy","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor/destroy","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Uses the outer allocator to call the destructor of the object pointed to by p, by calling","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/scoped_allocator\">&lt;scoped_allocator&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> destroy<span class=\"br0\">(</span> T<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> p <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Uses the outer allocator to call the destructor of the object pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code>, by calling\n</p><p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/allocator_traits\"><span class=\"kw705\">std::<span class=\"me2\">allocator_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>OUTERMOST<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">destroy</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>OUTERMOST<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, p<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</p><p>where OUTERMOST is the type that would be returned by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">this<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>outer_allocator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, and then calling the <code>outer_allocator()</code> member function recursively on the result of this call until reaching the type that has no such member function.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> p\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the object that is going to be destroyed\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/allocator_traits/destroy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>destroy</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destructs an object stored in the allocated storage <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/allocator/destroy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>destroy</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(until C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destructs an object in allocated storage <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::allocator&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path":"memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor","title":"std::scoped_allocator_adaptor"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::scoped_allocator_adaptor<OuterAlloc,InnerAlloc...>::destroy","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Uses the outer allocator to call the destructor of the object pointed to by p, by calling"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"p"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"destroy","note":"destructs an object stored in the allocated storage"},{"label":"destroy","note":"destructs an object in allocated storage"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":111,"codeBlockCount":0}
